From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t3code-customize <t3code-customize@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:06:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] feat(server): read Codex usage limits through the
 running session

The shared usage-limits patch polls Codex limits through a reader the
Codex adapter registers. That hook came with the stats-for-nerds patch,
which this fork leaves out (skip-shared.json); this carries only the
reader: once the session's app-server connection is initialized it asks
account/rateLimits/read, times out after 3 seconds and never spawns or
initializes anything itself.
---
 .../Adapters/CodexAdapterV2.test.ts           | 80 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../Adapters/CodexAdapterV2.ts                | 28 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

